          "speaker": "Felix Martinez",
          "speaker_role": "partner at Seedcamp",
          "rationale": "Seedcamp 认为 Vessla 团队拥有开发前沿 AI 应用的经验，尤其是在高风险企业环境中部署这些应用的良好记录，这解释了为何行业领先公司迅速对其表现出浓厚兴趣。",
          "quote": "According to Felix Martinez, a partner at Seedcamp, the Vessla team has experience developing cutting-edge AI applications, and this experience, particularly their track record of deploying them in high-stakes enterprise environments, is responsible for the considerable interest leading companies in the industry have shown in them so quickly.",
