          "speaker_role": "founder and partner at the Inception Fund",
          "rationale": "Inception Fund 认为垂直 AI 的赢家将成为客户的外部 AI 研发部门，持续将最新技术转化为实际价值，而 Vessla 具备帮助物业公司保持领先的技术深度。",
          "quote": "AI is advancing faster than most companies can keep up. What is built in-house today could be outdated in three months. The winners in vertical AI will become their customers’ external AI R&D department, continuously turning the latest technology into practical value. Vessla has the technical depth to help property companies stay ahead. That is why we invested",
